  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      266.33,
      401.9,
      290.27
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.13,
      401.9,
      328.07
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Social SecurityContribution Levy (Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      341.93,
      401.88,
      391.07
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 4 of the Social Security Contribution LevyAct, No. 25 of 2022 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (1) thereof asfollows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      404.93,
      401.86,
      428.87
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the repeal of paragraph (b) thereof, and thesubstitution therefor, of the following: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.13,
      442.73,
      401.91,
      517.07
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(b)for any quarter commencing prior to January1, 2024, not later than fifteen days from thedate on which the aggregate of the turnoverfor a quarter exceeds or likely to exceed thirtymillion rupees, in the case of a taxable personto whom paragraph (a) does not apply;\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      531.17,
      401.82,
      555.47
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the addition immediately after paragraph (b)thereof, of the following: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      570.17,
      401.89,
      672.47
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(c)for any period commencing on or afterJanuary 1, 2024, not later than fifteen daysfrom the date on which the aggregate of theturnover for a quarter exceeds or likely toexceed fifteen million rupees or from the dateon which the aggregate of the turnover for aperiod of consecutive four quarters exceedsor likely to exceed sixty million rupees.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
